{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nWe have arrived safely in Brunswick, having endured a night in that green morocco carriage which, despite its plush, felt more like a coffin than a conveyance. The coachman arrangement in Magdeburg proved a fiasco, forcing us into this diligence. I am exhausted, but the mind finds some relief in the museum. We viewed the picture gallery, including the specific painting Schulz mentioned. It possesses a certain quiet dignity, though I confess I am too weary to dissect its aesthetic merits fully. The Englishman slept soundly, to his credit. I shall write to the boys when I can sit down properly. Do not worry; I am merely tired, not ill. The journey continues tomorrow.\n\nYours affectionately,\nWilhelm"}}],"created":1795218871,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":158,"prompt_tokens":947,"total_tokens":1105,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-nFqSl1Th0eH7zbFIXMi4uiDYsAx5db2M","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":947,"prompt_ms":940.038,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9926483632523759,"prompt_per_second":1007.4060835838552,"predicted_n":158,"predicted_ms":3705.82,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.60394904458599,"predicted_per_second":42.36579218634473}}